1 PUBL MyHeritage
1 RIN MH:S192
1 NOTE Birth records represent one of the key primary sources for family information, typically being issued within days of birth and containing the parents' names at a minimum. Many times they contain additional parental details including places of bir
2 CONC th, ages, number of children and religious affiliation for baptism and christening records.
